---
name: changelog-writer
description: 'Adds an entry to CHANGELOG.md from commits since the last tag. Use when the user asks to update the changelog before a release.'
license: MIT
---

# Changelog Writer

1. Find the last tag with `git describe --tags --abbrev=0`.
2. List commits since that tag.
3. Add a section for the new version to the top of CHANGELOG.md, grouped by Added, Changed, and Fixed.
